User Story: iOS 18 Trueplay Support
Task: Collect User Feedback

Overview:
As a tester, I facilitated the collection of user feedback on the iOS 18 Trueplay Support feature.
Testing included creating scenarios for users to interact with the feature, gathering insights
on ease of use, performance, and satisfaction. Feedback indicated that the feature was intuitive
and met user expectations, with suggestions focused on minor UI enhancements.
